1
00:00:00,582 --> 00:00:03,692
(Jesse:)Haven't seen you in forever.
Look how gray you've gotten.

2
00:00:03,852 --> 00:00:06,192
(Stuart:)My hair's exactly
the same color as always.

3
00:00:06,354 --> 00:00:08,464
(Jesse:)No, I was talking about your skin.

4
00:00:09,858 --> 00:00:11,968
Look... my friend here
needs a comic book--

5
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,370
Ooh! And she went into
your store by mistake.

6
00:00:14,963 --> 00:00:17,133
(Jesse:)Good thing there was no
one there to see you.

7
00:00:17,832 --> 00:00:19,172
(Jesse:)What do you need?

8
00:00:19,834 --> 00:00:22,814
(Jesse:)Oh, yeah, yeah. I got this.
Right over here.

9
00:00:25,307 --> 00:00:27,047
(Stuart:)Even you, Sweatpants?

10
00:00:27,208 --> 00:00:28,988
(Sweatpants:)Free popcorn.

11
00:00:30,645 --> 00:00:32,315
(Jesse:)Can I offer you a coffee?

12
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:34,820
(Jesse:)-Espresso? Latte?
-No, thanks.

13
00:00:34,983 --> 00:00:36,793
(Jesse:)How about you, Stu?
Mocha? Scone?

14
00:00:36,951 --> 00:00:39,231
(Jesse:)Directions to the
nearest soup kitchen?

15
00:00:40,455 --> 00:00:41,905
(Sheldon:)-Hey.
-I'm just kidding.

16
00:00:42,057 --> 00:00:44,227
(Jesse:)He knows where the soup kitchen is.

17
00:00:46,728 --> 00:00:48,298
(Stuart:)It's on Merton Avenue.

18
00:00:49,864 --> 00:00:52,174
(Bernadette:)I don't think I like the way
you're treating my friend.

19
00:00:52,334 --> 00:00:53,814
(Sheldon:)Sorry.

20
00:00:53,968 --> 00:00:56,178
-You want the book or nut?
-Not from you.

21
00:00:56,871 --> 00:01:01,021
(Bernadette:)Let's go, Stuart.

